@startuml C4-Dynamic-Chat-Tools
!include style-zinc.puml

title Dynamic — Chat tools SSE

actor User as user
participant "Chat page\n/chat" as ui <<ui>>
participant "Java API\nchat + tools :9000" as api <<java>>
participant "DeepSeek API" as llm <<external>>
participant "Serper.dev" as serper <<external>>
database "H2" as db <<db>>

user -> ui: 1. Send message (tools on)
ui -> api: 2. POST /api/text/chat/stream
api -> db: 3. Load ChatSession + memory
api -> llm: 4. Chat + tool schemas
llm --> api: 5. Tool call (optional)
api -> serper: 6. searchWeb (if enabled)
serper --> api: 7. Web results (optional)
api --> ui: 8. SSE tool_call / tool_result
api -> llm: 9. Continue with tool output
llm --> api: 10. Assistant tokens
api -> db: 11. Persist ChatMessage / WebSource
api --> ui: 12. SSE text + optional A2UI fence
ui --> user: 13. Streamed reply (+ chart)

legend right
  |= Role |= Color |
  | Actor | Emerald |
  | <<ui>> | Slate |
  | <<java>> | Blue |
  | <<db>> | Amber |
  | <<external>> | Zinc gray |
endlegend

note right of ui
  A2UI chart fence in assistant
  text when tools return chartable data
end note

@enduml
